Package: cordial-hrd
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: cordial-hrd local build <root@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: systemd (>= 254), iproute2, nftables, wireguard-tools, dbus-daemon, gnome-keyring, libcap2-bin, @SHLIBS@
Recommends: cordial-hrd-client
Suggests: cage, mesa-vulkan-drivers
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/kamasix/HRD
Description: Terminal-only manager for many Cordial clients
 A daemon (cordiald), a command line (cordialctl) and two small privileged
 helpers that run many independent Cordial clients, each with its own profile,
 process set and network group, on a Debian server without a desktop.
 .
 The package starts nothing by itself: no client, no network change. It does not
 contain the Roblox application or the client binary (see cordial-hrd-client);
 the Roblox build is imported by the operator with `cordialctl runtime import`.
